Table~\ref{tab:dr_threshold} shows D\&R sensitivity to the detection threshold: PPL rises monotonically from 17.28 ($q{>}0.5$) to 17.42 ($q{>}0.9$), a 0.14 spread that underscores D\&R's dependence on threshold calibration.
